<title>GREECE: Greek monetary policy is still tight - cbank.</title>
<headline>Greek monetary policy is still tight - cbank.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The stance of Greek monetary policy is indicated by the basic deposit facility rate and the fixed rate on the 14-day deposit tender, both currently at 11.90 percent, a high-level official at the central bank told Reuters.</p>
<p>&quot;The basic rate of the deposit facility and the fixed rate in the central bank's 14-day depo tender signal the stance of monetary policy,&quot; the high-level official at the Bank of Greece told Reuters. &quot;Monetary policy remains the same and is tight.&quot;</p>
</text>
